---
import ContactSection from "../components/ContactSection.astro";
import ImageGallery from "../components/ImageGallery.astro";
import InteriorLayout from "../layouts/InteriorLayout.astro";
import collective from "../data/collective.generated.json";
---
<InteriorLayout title="Collective" description="Explore the Golden Earth Studio Collective and work made from reclaimed construction materials." image={collective[0]?.image}>
  <main id="content" class="interior-main collective-page">
    <header class="page-intro page-intro--center"><h1>The Collective</h1><p>Bridging the gap between creatives and construction in pursuit of circularity.</p></header>
    <section class="editorial-lead"><p>Local artists, ceramicists, students and communities made their way to our construction site in Wimbledon to reclaim construction by-products and transform the material through their unique practices. Emphasising displaced material through art creates a conversation.</p><p>Our goal is to help artists and makers, established and emerging, work in more sustainable ways while continuing the conversation around a circular economy.</p></section>
    <section aria-labelledby="absent-boundaries"><div class="section-heading-row"><h2 id="absent-boundaries">Absent Boundaries</h2><span></span></div><p class="section-intro">From 3D-printed ceramic lamps to natural dyes for fabrics, we are in awe of how waste has been reimagined.</p><ImageGallery label="Golden Earth Studio Collective" images={collective.map((item) => ({ src: item.image, alt: item.alt, caption: item.caption }))} /></section>
    <section class="split-editorial">
      <article><h2>An extended invite</h2><p>With each new construction project, Golden Earth Studio invites creatives from all backgrounds to collect free clay, make, and sell their works through GES.</p></article>
      <article><h2>A Clay Zine</h2><p>We understand there is uncertainty around using non-commercial clays. The Clay Zine compiles knowledge about how creatives use the material, aiming to demystify challenges and spark inspiration.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="https://forms.gle/ZJZKaECPYKiSs7bw8">Submit a contribution</a></p></article>
      <article><h2>Collect Free Clay</h2><p>We share clay collection opportunities through our Instagram page.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/goldenearthstudio/">Check current collections</a></p></article>
    </section>
    <ContactSection />
  </main>
</InteriorLayout>
